+/* UNIT_IDLE: the units that poll while attached (multiplexer, synchronous
+   line, parallel device) and the silo alarm timer allow the CPU to idle.
+   The polling units are coscheduled with the clock (DMF_POLL), so the next
+   event is never closer than one clock tick; an event due in less than the
+   host's minimum sleep time (about 1 ms) prevents idling altogether. */
